WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.200
This feels so nice!

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.740
Yume!

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.120
What beautiful weather.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.040
Right?

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.830
And wouldn't you know,

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:25.170
this comes right after I made my Ako-brand teru teru girls. {certainly we've done this before, not that I can recall, but wiki has teru teru bozu}{I always find the capitalization awkward (even when it's teru teru bozu)}

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.630
Teru teru girls?

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:29.750
Ako-chan made them last night.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.260
Teru teru girls!

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.630
They worked like a charm! {so perfect}

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:36.680
The skies and our hearts are full of sunshine!

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.270
We're here!

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:51.070
We're pretty lucky we all got our schedules to line up.

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.940
We couldn't travel very far though.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:55.150
Are we ready to have some fun?

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.030
Yeah!

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.000
Let's go!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.520
Are we okay to go?

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:46.720
Ready!

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:47.350
Yume-chan, hurry!

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:47.350
Come on!

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:48.020
Right!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.880
Here you are, Yume-chan.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:22.640
Thanks, Koharu-chan.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:26.350
I'm glad that Rola's having a good time.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.060
You're "it" next, Ako!

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:28.850
Give me a break!

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:28.850
Me too.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:33.980
I still remember how badly I messed up when you went away.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.780
This time, I want to part with a smile.

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:39.820
Me too.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:50.160
Hold it, Rola! Be sure to eat your green peppers too!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.710
I'm not exactly the biggest fan...

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:59.170
Green peppers have twice as much vitamin C as lemons. {three times as much}

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.420
If you want healthy skin, vegetables are—

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:02.880
I get it already!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.550
I'll eat them, Mommy Mahiru.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.220
Honestly!

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.140
This is scrumptious!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:15.900
You've got a big appetite, Ako-chan.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:19.980
I need to eat up if I want to last through my movie filming.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.650
What movie?

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.950
The theatrical release of Idol Mermaid.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.950
Congrats!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:32.370
I spoke with Nii-san, and he said M4 was expanding into the rest of Asia.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:37.340
That's right. We'll be filming at different locations all around the continent.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:43.510
Subaru-kyun is playing a super idol, 
and Kanata-senpai is my agency's president.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:48.390
The plot features a love triangle with them fighting over my mermaid character!

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:51.850
I-It's the kind of fantasy that would enrapture any girl's heart!{longness}

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.020
Ako-chan, you're so cute!

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:56.560
I have heaps of other jobs lined up as well.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.110
Like a commercial for the FuwaFuwa Dream Randoseru.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.900
And SAH! {I'm going to typeset this, do I really need to have this line?}{your call, since it depends on how it ends up looking}

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.110
Kids love you, so those all sound perfect.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:10.120
In any case, I need to be on the offensive more than ever before!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.250
I'm going to be more aggressive too.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:13.540
You are?

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:18.290
Onee-chan, Tsubasa-senpai, and I 
decided to revive our unit.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:22.760
That's wonderful! Sky-Girl will fly together again!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:29.260
Thanks. That performance apparently made big waves, and our fans are really looking forward to it.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.560
Things like that are the best.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:37.270
Right? Also, Elza-san's already sent us an offer to be in the next Venus Wave.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.230
Elza-san knows already?!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.440
That's Elza-san for you!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:45.650
Sky-Girl will defeat Elza Forte at long last! {holy shit, is this DB Supers ep 132?}

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.660
I'm stuffed.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.370
So what are the two of you planning to do?

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:02.170
Koharu-chan and I are drawing up plans for a new Rainbow Berry Parfait event.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:08.340
And not just for our brand. We're working on a collaboration with My Little Heart too.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:09.640
That's great!

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.850
Sounds like it'll be a fun event.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:12.890
Yeah!

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:14.100
And you, Rola?

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:18.140
I'm leaving for England next week.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.770
Aren't you concerned about being by yourself?

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.820
Oh, but she won't be alone.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:26.740
Here, for you.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:29.660
Weren't these from when...

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:35.580
Yep! They're the dolls you all made me when I went to Italy.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:38.000
Now it's your turn to take them.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.380
It's true, I'm not alone.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:48.590
Even if we're apart, thinking about all of you doing your Aikatsu will give me strength.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.800
Thanks, girls!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.760
It is as Goethe said:

00:06:55.010 --> 00:07:00.390
"One does not travel in order to arrive, but for the sake of the journey itself." {I actually found the original in German, for the first time all series}{what is it? I can't find it}{Man reist ja nicht, um anzukommen, sondern um zu reisen}

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.730
Lily-senpai and Yuzu-senpai?

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.110
Here we are!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:13.120
There is something I wish to tell you before we graduate.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.030
Okay.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:19.710
As your senior at Four Star Academy, I have had the pleasure of watching over you.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:25.250
You have faced many hardships precisely because of your dedication to Aikatsu.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:30.130
However, you refused to abandon it, constantly keeping your chins up.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:34.640
I found that to be the epitome of beauty.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:44.020
Friends that you can share an earnest pursuit of 
brilliance with are more important than any pretty dress.{this could be split and/or changed}{is this better? there's no good place to split it but the margins were uncomfortable}

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.940
Lily-senpai!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:51.280
Oh, that's right! Yuzu's got something to say before graduating too.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:55.450
The next student council president is gonna be Koharu-chan! {FUCK YES}

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:58.080
What?! You never told me!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.000
It rests on your shoulders now, Nanakura Koharu-kun!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.960
N-N-N...

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.830
No way!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.430
That was a blast!

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.350
Time flies when you're having fun.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:24.350
Let's all come back here one day!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.440
Yeah!

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:28.150
Wait, where did Yuzu-senpai and Lily-senpai go?

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.990
Attention, please!

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:34.320
Please stand away from the white line!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:38.620
The Set Off With A Felicitai-tai Express will be arriving shortly!{this looks weird}

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.200
"Set off with a"...

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.580
"Felicitai-tai"?

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:43.460
It's here!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:48.880
What in the world is this?

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.590
A trolley?

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:54.930
It's a limited express train to celebrate Rola-chan's departure!{I can't think of anything better, but I want to note that "limited express" trains are typically actual express trains}{I'm just dicking around, but it's true that it didn't make any stops until the very last}

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:59.390
The student council, admins, and teachers all pitched in

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:03.180
and prepared this special surprise for Rola-san!

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.600
Did you know about this?

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.230
No, not at all.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.230
When did you get this all together?

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.520
Forget about that and hop on!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:12.690
All aboard!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:24.370
We are about to enter a tunnel. 
Please be aware of your surroundings.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.840
Please take a look out to your right!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.510
Rola-chan!

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:39.930
Thank you!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:41.390
Take care!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.220
Do your best!

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.770
Rola! Look!

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.690
Felicitaiyaki?!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.440
Thank you! This means so much!

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.650
Felicitai-tai! Felicitai-tai!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.030
Look, it's Natsuna-chan!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.490
And Saaya-chan with her friends!

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.490
Hooray! Hooray! Rola!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.250
Go for it! Go for it! Rola! {I think this part of the cheer is new}

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.790
Do your best too, Yume-chan!

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:10.330
Yume-chan!

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:14.550
Osu!

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:27.140
Yume-chan and Koharu-chan, and also Mahiru-chan and Ako-chan's fans all came pouring in.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.690
Thank you!

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:45.580
Isn't this great, Rola?

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:46.500
Yeah!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.080
I just can't stand and watch!

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.380
Hey, what are you doing?

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:54.590
Let's go!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:55.750
What?!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:56.510
Come on!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:57.340
Yeah!

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:02.090
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:03.850
How about it, Ako?

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.930
I-If I must.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.600
Ako-chan, you're so cute!

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:10.100
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:22.280
Rola-chan! {checked CCs for this}

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.120
Do your utmost!

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.120
Mahiru-neesan!

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:36.920
Yume Nijino!

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:40.090
Elza-san?!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:46.010
Good day. The time we spent together served well to polish my perfection even further.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.810
You have my gratitude.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:51.810
Just imagining where your Aikatsu will lead you is truly intriguing.{timing}{I noticed}

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.810
We have steak ready and waiting! {fucken jiiya, this wasn't in the CCs}

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:55.980
Forgetting about Kirara would be baa! You got it?!

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:59.650
Lovely! Knowing you're not alone is very lovely!{come on, we made this a thing and you're going to away from it at the very end?}{I was excited}

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.070
Nijino-san!

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:02.910
Congratulations!

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:02.910
Congratulation!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.570
Venus Ark! And even Yuri-senpai!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.580
You who love Aikatsu!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.120
And you who are beloved by Aikatsu!

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.750
Dreams aren't meant for dreaming!

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:15.130
They're meant to be fulfilled, baby!

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.920
We are Four Star!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.000
We are Four Star!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.430
Hime-senpai!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.600
Onee-chan!

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.020
And Tsubasa-senpai?

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.900
Why are you all here?

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.480
Welcome back!

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:41.320
We've been waiting for you.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.910
Now, a toast to your new start lines.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.950
Congratulations!

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:55.790
It's like a rainbow!

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:58.210
What did you think of the surprise?

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:02.840
It was the best! Hearing everyone's cheers filled me with strength.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.630
We had a lot of fun too!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:08.220
I never could've imagined so many people would show up. {I prever}

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:10.470
We can't thank them enough.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.560
From the bottom of our hearts...

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:14.980
Thank you so much!

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:20.020
One more thing!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.650
What is it?

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:28.240
Well, I was just thinking about how I could possibly repay everyone for this incredible celebration.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:33.580
Plus, I still haven't properly said goodbye to my fans.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:35.830
That's why...

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.540
I want to sing!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:44.670
I want to give the best performance I possibly can to convey my gratitude!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.970
We knew you'd say that!

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.180
The stage is ready for you.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:55.680
All five of you will be going on together, right?

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.270
Your many fans await you.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.400
Right!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:19.290
This marks the first step over our new start line!

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.420
Fully dedicated...

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.500
All five of us...

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.000
Doing the best we can!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.760
Let's make this an unforgettable show!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:26.840
All together!

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.510
Aikatsu!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:26.100
These two years passed by in a flash.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:30.650
I admired S4, entered Four Star Academy with Koharu-chan,{given akogare's status in the endpart, I think we should use a single consistent word for it (we could also use "inspire" for this episode, since that's one we've used for akogare before}

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.400
and met Rola, Mahiru-chan, and Ako-chan.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:38.120
Doing Aikatsu with our senpai was inspiring and tons of fun.{are we doing it so that only kouhai can use the word senpai?}{I just follow my heart}

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:41.240
They taught us so many important lessons.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:45.160
We chased after the objects of our admiration, grew and matured,

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:48.750
and endured hardships that at times made us cry.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:55.920
I'll never forget the times we shared on stage, 
our brands and dresses, or the Star Wings we earned.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:18:01.680
Each encounter and farewell made us a little bit stronger.

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:48.560
Yume and Rola sure are taking their time.

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.060
Sorry I'm late!

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:52.900
Wait, where's Rola?

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:54.360
Wasn't she with you?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:57.320
I was sure she'd gotten here ahead of me.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:07.500
"Sorry, Yume. Pulling off that amazing show got me too hyped!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:11.750
I can't wait to start my Aikatsu, so I've decided to leave right away"...

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:15.130
Rola...

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:15.960
Yume!

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.010
We'll take care of things here.

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:19.800
You can still catch her.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:20.840
Yume-chan!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:22.800
Thanks! I'll find her!

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:27.100
You too, girls.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:29.230
Leave no regrets.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.730
Be safe!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.850
Go! Go! Go!

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:34.190
Right!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:42.410
<i>Yume, our Aikatsu won't end.</i>

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:47.990
<i>Let's continue to grow so that the next time we meet will be on the world stage.</i>

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:51.960
<i>There's no need for a teary farewell.</i>

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:54.330
<i>Saying goodbye would just make me sad.</i>

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.550
Rola!

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.550
Yume!

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.180
How'd you find me?

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:10.180
Just how long do you think we've been together?

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:14.060
Come on, I was trying to pull off a cool departure here!

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:21.320
Thanks, Yume.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.990
And thank you. Have a good journey, Rola.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.540
Rola!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.220
See you again!

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:44.010
Rola!

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.010
Do your best!

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:45.840
Be safe!

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:45.840
Never give up!

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:51.480
Hey, everyone out there. 
Are you chasing after a dream?

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:56.350
Becoming a model, becoming a patissiere, becoming an idol.{did we spell it pâtissière before?}{I meant to include that in this comment but guess I didn't. I don't want to draw away from what she's saying either}

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:59.400
There's an endless number of dreams out there.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.740
Let's run after our dreams!

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:04.150
Let's head towards them at full speed!

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:07.240
Because... because dreams...

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:51.220
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:54.850
The World Aikatsu Cup is finally underway!

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:59.730
Idols each representing a country will compete for the title in this tournament.

00:22:59.730 --> 00:23:04.650
Who will shine as the number one idol?!

00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:07.900
Yume-chan, all of Japan's hopes rest on your shoulders.{don't let them down, shohei otani}

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:09.490
I know.

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:10.410
Still...

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:13.160
It doesn't look like an easy road.

00:23:14.990 --> 00:23:17.500
It's time for the first stage!

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:22.790
Japan's representative Yume Nijino versus England's representative Rola Sakuraba! {leave this}{sorry but this is really funny and also very appropriate and also extremely satisfying and also really funny}

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:27.010
Believe it or not, just one short year ago these two were classmates at Four Star Academy!

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:30.220
We're kicking off with a rival match!

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:35.010
Facing off against you in the first round gets me going!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:38.730
Me too. I've grown a lot since back then.

00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:41.020
I'll come at you with all I've got, Rola.

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:44.520
So will I! Let's fire this place up together!

00:23:44.520 --> 00:23:48.070
Yeah, let's do it! I can't contain my excitement!

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:51.780
Our Aikatsu will keep on going!
